WEBVTT

00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:07.630
In this video, you will find the neighborhood contests, where you can vote for your favorite homes, enter your own, or see who won.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:08.612
We start on the map.

00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:11.249
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:16.732
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.588 --> 00:00:19.568
Then tap Allow.

00:00:24.907 --> 00:00:28.117
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:30.897
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:35.460
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.161
Tap it.

00:00:38.763 --> 00:00:40.722
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:42.296 --> 00:00:46.405
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:46.405 --> 00:00:48.832
This opens on your own page, Mine.

00:00:48.832 --> 00:00:52.187
To see every contest that is open today, tap Live now.

00:00:53.894 --> 00:00:57.089
Live now lists the contests that are open today.

00:00:57.089 --> 00:01:01.800
On each one, you can vote for your favorite homes, or enter your own home.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:08.146
Voting and entering each have their own dates, shown on the card, so a contest shows what you can do right now.

00:01:09.005 --> 00:01:09.862
Tap Mine.

00:01:11.706 --> 00:01:13.710
This is your personal page.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:21.156
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, with buttons to manage them or view them, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:01:21.983 --> 00:01:24.618
Tap Past results, for contests that are finished.

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:30.382
You can see the winners in every category, and look back at earlier years.

00:01:31.237 --> 00:01:35.884
That is the Contests page: Live now, Mine, and Past results.

00:01:35.884 --> 00:01:44.080
Contests also show up on the map as cards, with a link to enter your home or vote, so you may find one without ever opening this page.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:48.704
If you are not signed in, the same page is under the three dots, then Contests.

00:01:50.073 --> 00:01:52.801
Next up: Find professionally installed homes.
